<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $41-5/8 (FIM 187.54).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADS ENDS AT $41-5/8 (FIM 187.54).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADS closed $0-7/8 higher at $41-5/8 in New York on Friday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 187.54 markka. In Helsinki on Friday Nokia closed down 0.40 markka at 185.50.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADS (two shares) rose $0-3/8 to $33-1/4 on Wall Street overnight. The price equals about 74.90 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed up 0.50 markka to 75.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADS was untraded after falling to $0-3/8 to $21 (94.61 markka) on Thursday in New York. In Helsinki, Rauma closed 0.50 markka lower at 95.00.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
